1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,800
Every lesson starts with a script.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,200
Write for the ear: one idea per sentence.

3
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:16,000
The voice is synthesized,
then every word is aligned.

4
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:21,400
Captions inherit those
timestamps instead of guessing.

5
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:26,800
Two lines, one idea, inside the safe area.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Then the cut: zooms,
callouts, and an export.
